    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Enemies you take down don't get up again.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When your attack drops a target to 0 Hit Points, you may choose to automatically kill that enemy even if the damage does not exceed the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>. In addition, you can perform the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Coup_de_Grace\" title=\"Coup de Grace\">Coup de Grace</a> Action as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> A creature that drops below 0 Hit Points becomes <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unconscious\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unconscious\">Unconscious</a> if the damage dealt does not exceed its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>. Performing a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Coup_de_Grace\" title=\"Coup de Grace\">Coup de Grace</a> is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>.</p>",
